{"id":"69f4f24da36d1d66","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Many-One Reduction","display":"df-polynomial-many-one-reduction — Polynomial-Time Many-One Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","aliases":["73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","73-df-polynomial-many-one-reduction"],"display":"df-polynomial-many-one-reduction — Polynomial-Time Many-One Reduction","depends_on":["[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</span><span>73-df-polynomial-many-one-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-many-one-reduction — Polynomial-Time Many-One Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0173e0f8c9568f2f\" href=\"?note=0173e0f8c9568f2f\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-string-functions\">73-df-polynomial-string-functions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (binary languages)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FP}\">\\(\\mathsf{FP}\\)</span> (total polynomial-time string functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0173e0f8c9568f2f\" href=\"?note=0173e0f8c9568f2f\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-string-functions\">73-df-polynomial-string-functions</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_m^p B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathsf{FP}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_m^p B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathsf{FP}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a total many-one reduction. The former dependency on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{coNP}\">\\(\\mathsf{coNP}\\)</span> was unrelated to its definition and has been removed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","status":"resolved","id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","status":"resolved","id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{FP}$ (total polynomial-time string functions, see [[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_m^p B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathsf{FP}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{coNP}","display":false}],"bytes":963,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0f365ef30b0b52a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_m^p$ (polynomial-time many-one reducibility, see [[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]])"},{"id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_m^p$ (polynomial-time many-one reducibility, see [[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]])"},{"id":"b744279d55b870f3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_m^p$ (polynomial-time many-one reducibility, see [[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]])"}],"outgoing":["0173e0f8c9568f2f"]}